The Florida ASA Chapter and ASA is sponsoring a half-day workshop hosted via Zoom by Florida State University on November 4, 2020. The topic is "Shiny Essentials" taught by Mine ?etinkaya-Rundel at the University of Edinburgh and RStudio. This half day course will introduce you to the basics of building web applications with Shiny.



